! Real known-indexed capture: CCP4 example insulin_1_001.img (SMV, 2304x2304).
! Source image: /apps/ccp4/ccp4-9/examples/data/insulin_1_001.img
! Run via tools/capture_ipmosflm_oracle.sh (handles CCP4/ncurses env + 2 phases).
!
! Phase 1 (spot finding; writes insulin_1.spt):
!   IMAGE insulin_1_001.img
!   DISTANCE 160.0
!   WAVELENGTH 0.9790
!   PIXEL 0.0816 0.0816
!   BEAM 94.0 94.7
!   SEPARATION 0.57 0.57
!   AUTOINDEX
!   GO
!
! Phase 2 (autoindex from spot list + integrate one frame; writes MTZ + genfile).
! IMAGE and PROCESS are mutually exclusive in a single run, so phase 2 relies on
! the .spt file (no IMAGE keyword) which leaves PROCESS legal.
GENFILE gen.dat
NEWMAT ins.mat
DIRECTORY .
TEMPLATE insulin_1_###.img
DISTANCE 160.0
WAVELENGTH 0.9790
PIXEL 0.0816 0.0816
BEAM 94.0 94.7
SEPARATION 0.57 0.57
autoindex dps threshold 20 hkldev 0.3 unfixdist nvect 30 nvref 30 solution 12 image 1 file "insulin_1.spt"
GO
CELL 78.190 78.190 78.190 90.0 90.0 90.0
SYMMETRY 197
MOSAIC 0.30
PROCESS 1 to 1 start 0.0 angle 1.0
GO
exit
